value.discoveredLetterText:
Your colonists have mastered firearms. But the very first look at the ammunition recipes may bring an unpleasant surprise: they require weapon parts, and such ammo may seem outrageously expensive.

Don't be discouraged - this is intentional. The balance here has been reworked as a whole, and there is more metal in the world than it seems:
- traders now bring noticeably more ore;
- meteorites deliver metal right to your doorstep;
- scrap metal can be smelted down;
- quarries yield stone and ore endlessly;
- scanners find deposits deep underground.

Don't give up. Every shot counts now, but a colony that sets up its mining will never run out of ammo.
